summary:
  The one function that sends a device its level sends it without asking
  the record whether the device plays the stream.

history:
  The slider, the wheel, the mute, the room's mute, the alarm and a
  device's own balance row all end in one function, and that is where the
  question belongs: asked on each road, the next road added forgets it.
  A ticked Ruark that had refused the stream was turned down from 10 to 6
  this way while a television beside it played (2026-11-12).

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          if (!CastLogic.plays(_castSession, dev.uuid)) return;

replace:
          if (false) return;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_level_is_sent_only_to_a_device_that_plays.
  Line-neutral.
